  task-board q 'schema(operation=project_config)'
  task-board q 'schema(mutation=set_status)'
  task-board q --format compact 'project_config(); models(agent=codex)'
  task-board q 'get(TASK-1) { status }; list(type=task) { id status }'
  task-board q --format compact 'list(type=task) { overview }'
  task-board q --format compact 'plan(EPIC-1, active=true)'
  task-board q 'plan(scope=[EPIC-1, STORY-2, TASK-3], mode=children)'

Usage:
