replay worktree parent directory resolution-template.json. Bind each resolution to REBASE_HEAD,
its unmerged path and the SHA-256 of the explicit replacement content. The tool
replays from the unchanged original checkpoints and signs continuation; never
hand-commit the retained replay or edit workspace registry records.

Usage:
  task-board worktree refresh-candidate <ELEMENT-ID> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help                        help for refresh-candidate
      --replay-resolutions string   JSON file of checkpoint-bound conflict resolutions

Global Flags:
      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default ".task-board")
      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite
      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)
      --json                     Output in JSON format
      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check
      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)
      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)

