codex
The broad `gitsnap -count=3` run is spending several minutes in repeated pack and fan-out fixtures; a full package repeat would exceed the bounded call. I’m stopping this broad repeat and narrowing it to the new assembly/content test families, then repeating the capture family separately. The full `gitsnap` package already passed once on this exact tree.
